### 1) Deep insert: document + 2 required signatures
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/Documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "DOC-2026-0003",
  "type_code": "DO",
  "title": "Delivery Order (test)",
  "signatures": [
    { "sequence": 1, "signerRole": "Shipping Line", "signerEmail": "ops@bluewave.example" },
    { "sequence": 2, "signerRole": "Consignee",     "signerEmail": "imports@sahyadri.example" }
  ]
}

### 2) Should FAIL: movement must be IN or OUT (enum + @assert.range)
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passNumber": "GP-2026-0099",
  "movement": "XX",
  "container_ID": "h1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "truckNumber": "KL07AB1234",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-13T06:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-13T18:00:00Z"
}

### 3) Should FAIL: invalid truck number format
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passNumber": "GP-2026-0098",
  "movement": "OUT",
  "container_ID": "h1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "truckNumber": "TRUCK-1",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-13T06:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-13T18:00:00Z"
}